  "content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><img src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/encased\" width=\"1023\" height=\"435\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/nFBAXfb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=5865f2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://github.com/iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=000000&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=FF0000&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/iglee42/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=f16436&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=1ace65&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></div>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"><span style=\"color: #808080; font-size: 30px;\">Create Encased</span> 是 <span style=\"color: #ff9900;\"><a style=\"font-weight: normal !important; color: #ff9900; font-size: 30px;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Create Mod</a> </span>的一個小型附加模組<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">此附加模組允許在軸、</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">齒輪和管道中使用所有外殼</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">目前支援的 Create 版本為 6.0.1</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: #ffcc00;\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 36px;\">原始構思來自 <a style=\"font-size: 36px;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrMLDEG\">MLDEG</a></span><br></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">您可以在您的整合包中使用此模組，但請勿將此模組重新發布到其他網站！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Curseforge 和 Modrinth 是唯一兩個官方發布此模組的網站</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2723\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/541199/description_4e1cb9c4-bc3f-41dd-8136-0e734888fb1f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"133\"></a></p>\n</div>",
